## Discovery

Observed before reading repository guidance in depth:
Google Antigravity CLI natively discovered the chough-workflow skill from .agents/skills/chough-workflow/SKILL.md upon workspace initialization. The skill was listed in active skills without requiring explicit coaching or manual configuration.
Repository instructions in AGENTS.md also pointed to chough next --environment <env> and skills/chough-workflow/SKILL.md.

Discovery friction noted:
In skills/chough-workflow/SKILL.md, the Host use section listed openai, claude, codex, cursor, gemini, and grok as chough init host options. However, chough init --host gemini defaults to .gemini/skills, whereas Antigravity CLI discovers skills in .agents/skills by convention. In this repository, only .agents/skills and .claude/skills were present. As a result, chough skill status reported openai and claude as installed hosts, but did not report gemini.

